        <section class="grid-third">

            <b class="full" id="descriptions"></b>
            <b class="full"><hr></b>

            <div class="full">
                <h3>PRODUCT DESCRIPTIONS</h3>
                <p>
                    here's how we describe cryptee to our friends and family in different ways.
                    <br>
                    we thought these could help and save you 5 extra minutes for your coffee break.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="full">
                <b>~100 characters</b>
                <p>cryptee is an encrypted platform for private documents, journals, photos, videos, and files.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="full">
                <b>~200 characters</b>
                <p>cryptee is an encrypted, zero-knowledge platform for writing documents, journaling, note-taking, and storing photos, videos, and files. it works on all devices and is based in tallinn, estonia, eu.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="full">
                <b>~500 characters</b>
                <p>cryptee is a zero-knowledge encrypted platform for documents, notes, journals, photos, videos, and file storage. everything is end-to-end encrypted — cryptee can't read your data, and neither can anyone else. it runs as a progressive web app, works on all devices with no installation required, and is built by a small, bootstrapped team in tallinn, estonia. cryptee is widely used by journalists, activists, researchers, and anyone who needs a genuinely private place to write and store sensitive information.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="full">
                <b>~800 characters</b>
                <p>cryptee is a zero-knowledge encrypted platform for documents, notes, journals, photos, videos, and file storage, built by a small, bootstrapped team in tallinn, estonia. everything is end-to-end encrypted before it leaves your device — cryptee has no ability to access your data, and neither does anyone else. it features a full document editor with markdown, latex, code highlighting, epub reading, and more, alongside encrypted photo, video, and file storage with album organization and offline support. as a progressive web app, it works across all devices without app store dependencies. cryptee is trusted by journalists, activists, human rights workers, and privacy-conscious individuals worldwide, and its founder actively advocates for digital rights at the european commission level.</p>
            </div>

            <b class="full"></b>
            <b class="full"><hr></b>
            <b class="full" id="advocacy"></b>

            <div class="full">
                <h3>ACTIVISM &amp; ADVOCACY</h3>
                <p>beyond building privacy tools, cryptee is an active voice in the fight for digital rights in europe and beyond. our founder and ceo john ozbay has twice represented cryptee and open web advocacy at the european commission's digital markets act hearings, directly confronting apple on anti-competitive practices that threaten the open web and progressive web apps. cryptee regularly co-signs coalition letters alongside organizations like edri, eff, mozilla, proton, the tor project, and dozens of others — challenging surveillance legislation, defending encryption, and pushing back against attempts to weaken the gdpr. for a full timeline of our advocacy work and research, <a href="/activism-advocacy-research">visit our activism, advocacy &amp; research page</a>.</p>
            </div>

            <b class="full"></b>
            <b class="full"><hr></b>
            <b class="full" id="links"></b>

            <div class="full">
                <h3>LINKS</h3>
                <p>we live in the age of disinformation, so we thought it's best we write down all our official channels of communications here. so if you'd like to link to one of them, you can link to the best possible source of information about us online.</p>
                <br><br>
                <p>please use secure urls, starting with <i>https</i> when linking to anything related to cryptee, and disable link tracking if possible. we would love for your readers to remain private and be safe.</p>
            </div>

            <p>
                <b>home page</b><br>
